  "part_number": {
    "model": "3360SE",
    "product": "SEL-3360 Automation Controller / Computing Platform (SEL-3360S and SEL-3360E)",
    "length": null,
    "prefix": {
      "positions": "1-8",
      "value": "SEL-3360S | SEL-3360E",
      "description": "SEL-3360 rugged industrial automation controller. The '3360SE' folder is a combined drawing family covering both the SEL-3360S (no PCI expansion, external 12 Vdc / SEL-9331 power supply) and the SEL-3360E (two PCIe expansion slots, integral LV/HV ac-dc power supply)."
    },
    "note": "No per-digit configurable part number is published for the SEL-3360 in any locally available source. The SEL-3360 Instruction Manual states 'Complete ordering information is not provided in this instruction manual. See the latest SEL-3360 Model Option Table at selinc.com.' The SEL-3360 Model Option Table is an online/interactive configurator (CPU, RAM, storage capacity/type, power supply, and SEL-3390-series PCIe expansion cards) and is not present as a static ordering-information document in the local SEL index; no genuine SEL-3360 part number strings were found in uploads, tests, the instruction manual, or the data sheet to calibrate a digit template against. Per the recipe addendum, no digit map is invented here. Drawing layers exist for this device (model_to_layers) but describe physical drawing groups (heatsink, model/cooling, power supply, PCI slots, expansion cards), not part-number digit columns, and were intentionally not lifted into positions. Configurable dimensions known from the data sheet: cooling/CPU (SEL-3360S i7-3555LE / i7-3612QE quad-core vs SEL-3360E conduction-cooled), RAM up to 16 GB ECC, dual 2.5\" SATA SSDs (SLC/pSLC/3D-TLC, 32-7680 GB), power supply (external 12 Vdc/SEL-9331 vs integral LV/HV ac-dc, Euro TB or IEC inlet), and PCIe cards SEL-3390S8 serial and SEL-3390E4 quad-gigabit Ethernet and SEL-3390T time & Ethernet.",
    "references": [
      "SEL-3360 Data Sheet (Data Sheets/3360_DS_20221221.pdf, PDS3360-01, date code 20221221)",
      "SEL-3360 Automation Controller Instruction Manual (Instruction Manuals/3360_IM_20221221.pdf) - notes complete ordering info is only in the online Model Option Table",
      "SEL-3360 Model Option Table (online, selinc.com) - not available locally as a static ordering-information document"
    ],
    "positions": []
  }
